'''Haterbaa 2.0''' (柏餅2.0, '''''[[wikipedia:Kashiwa mochi|Kashiwa Mochi]] 2.0''''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Baa Baa]] introduced in [[Lovesick Again (Monthly Event)|Lovesick Again]]. It was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]].

