==Enemy==
Haterbaa 2.0 is a Metal enemy with high attack power and DPS, though with very low health. While it may seem very threatening, due to its Single Attack it acts like a more fragile version of [[Capy]]/[[Lucky Dags]] with a faster attack rate and shorter range.

==Strategy==
Haterbaa 2.0 has very low health despite its Metal ability, so fast attackers and cheap units such as meatshields are recommended. In most of its event stage appearances, [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] work well against this enemy. However, at higher magnifications, [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]] such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] or [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] may be necessary to dispatch of it quickly.

